TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_3631_CC62';
<p>3631_cc62</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #58651c;">Gene C</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #58651c;"><i>chummy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #58651c;">Gene C</span> shows behavior where it always maintains a close distance to other flies.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #0061a6;">Gene K</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #0061a6;"><i>kidney</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #0061a6;">Gene K</span> has a body shape that is curved, similar to a kidney bean.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #8c3c73;">Gene P</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #8c3c73;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8c3c73;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, kidney, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e7f0c1; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #dfebff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f0; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">25</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e7f0c1; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #dfebff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">212</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e7f0c1; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0061a6;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f0; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">552</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">chummy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e7f0c1; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">c</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0061a6;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">173</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #58651c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #dfebff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f0; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">167</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">kidney</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #58651c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #dfebff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">k</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">608</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #58651c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0061a6;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe0f0; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">228</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #58651c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #0061a6;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8c3c73;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">35</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the <span style="color: DarkRed;"><strong>parental genotype combinations</strong></span>. These are the allele combinations that the parent fruit flies originally carried.</p> <p>More than one genotype will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_3631_CC62
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_1';
ckp
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_2';
ck+
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_3';
c+p
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_4';
c++
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_5';
+kp
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_6';
+k+
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_6
$choice_7 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_7';
++p
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_7
$choice_8 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_8';
+++
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CHOICE_8
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CORRECT_1';
c+p
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CORRECT_1
$correct_2 = <<'LITERAL_3631_CC62_CORRECT_2';
+k+
LITERAL_3631_CC62_CORRECT_2
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6, $choice_7, $choice_8);
@correct = ($correct_1, $correct_2);
$answer = CheckboxList([@choices], [@correct], labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->checks\}
END_TEXT
